prompt_template:
Use case: ads-marketing. Create one finished premium sports campaign poster as a {ASPECT_RATIO} full-bleed raster. The visual system is extreme near-to-far athletic photography, monumental white oblique typography and dark-to-luminous colored atmosphere. Prioritized visual anchors:
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Subject and action: {SUBJECT}
Near-camera focal evidence: {FOCAL_DETAIL}
Design intention and ratio planning: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Palette: {PALETTE}
Render exactly three text strings, each once, with no quotation marks: large headline "{MAIN_TEXT}"; small series label "{SERIES_TEXT}"; small supporting line "{SUPPORT_TEXT}". The headline must remain completely readable with correct letter order; choose line breaks and bounded overlap to serve the action. Keep small copy clear and comfortably inside the canvas.
Image treatment: Clean commercial photographic compositing without paper grain or halftone. Keep tactile microtexture on the near basketball, snowboard base, wet paddle blade or boxing leather. Put broad soft directional motion into passing surfaces and colored atmosphere; preserve purposeful peripheral softness. Snow and water appear only as physically motivated spray near the action, never random decorative particles.
Use dramatic sculptural lighting and physically plausible connected anatomy/equipment. Clothes and equipment are plain and unmarked: no logos, emblems, patches, numbers or decorative pseudo-lettering on jerseys, gloves, board bases, boats, helmets or balls. No extra words or symbols.
Source content to replace entirely:
{SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
Deliver a polished, sparse campaign image with a clear sport-specific design contribution, not a mockup on a wall.
